# NCAA KICKOFF FRESHNESS (ARCHITECT 2026-10-09, addendum 19 item 3): "On the host, the stored kickoff of
# every NCAA game in the next seven days is at most one day old." sync-matches NCAA for today..today+7,
# single-day calls, every day of the week (ncaa-market runs Tue-Sat only). Twice a day, so one failed run
# still leaves every stored kickoff under a day old. A NEW timer on a live host: see docs/specs/hosting-h1.md.
# H0-3: no timer fires inside the 04:15-05:15 UTC reboot buffer (tests/test_hosting_pack.py).
[Unit]
Description=sports-predictor timer: sp-ncaa-schedule

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 10,22:35:00 UTC
Unit=sp-chain@ncaa-schedule.service
Persistent=true
AccuracySec=1min

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
